{"unit_id":"BAIYE0303__dsh-ask-first#card-zh","repo":"BAIYE0303/dsh-ask-first","commit":"36d9adff17cca1821e82cab3356b26d3773e28db","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ask-first 是面向 DSH Web 输入框的需求澄清插件。在发送草稿前，它会先复述理解，再根据内容提出可点击回答的问题，随后将原意和回答整理成包含目标、约束与完成标准的请求。用户可以填写选项或补充文字，也可以让系统代为选择；未知信息会保留为待补充占位。结果可以回填到输入框，用户仍自行决定是否发送。它适合想把简短或含糊想法整理成清晰任务的 DSH 用户，使用宿主当前配置的 LLM 服务，无需单独填写插件密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-59","lib/index.js:140-163","lib/client.js:24-30"]}
{"unit_id":"BAIYE0303__dsh-ask-first#card-en","repo":"BAIYE0303/dsh-ask-first","commit":"36d9adff17cca1821e82cab3356b26d3773e28db","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ask-first clarifies rough drafts in the DSH web composer. It restates intent, asks clickable questions, and rewrites the draft with a goal and completion criteria. Users return the result to the composer and choose whether to send it. It uses the host LLM service and needs no plugin key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-59","lib/index.js:140-163","lib/client.js:24-30"]}
