{"unit_id":"BAIYE0303__dsh-ask-first#feature-1","repo":"BAIYE0303/dsh-ask-first","commit":"36d9adff17cca1821e82cab3356b26d3773e28db","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ask-first 的功能「复述并提出澄清问题」：根据输入草稿生成一句理解复述和最多三道问题，每题带可点击选项；在用户点击输入框按钮后触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-45","lib/index.js:140-163","lib/client.js:24-30"]}
