{"unit_id":"BAIYE0303__dsh-ask-first#feature-3","repo":"BAIYE0303/dsh-ask-first","commit":"36d9adff17cca1821e82cab3356b26d3773e28db","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ask-first 的功能「将结果放回输入框」：用户确认重写文本后，可把它写回 DSH composer 草稿继续编辑；此操作不会替用户发送消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:24-30"]}
